        "char_start": 120062,
        "char_end": 120389
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "BR.DECRETO.9580.2018#161",
      "type": "artigo_candidato",
      "name": "Art. 99",
      "content": "art. 99\n(Lei nş 8.069, de 13 de julho de 1990, art. 260-A\n;\nLei nş 9.250, de 1995, art. 12, § 1ş\n;\nLei nş 9.532, de 1997, art. 22\n; e\nLei nş 11.438, de 2006, art. 1ş, § 1ş, inciso II).\n§ 2ş A deduçăo de que trata o inciso VI do\ncaput\n, observado o disposto no",
      "attributes": {
